ederal consumer protections that apply to health insurance",lstrBenefits_FixedIndemnityPlan_Point5TextPart1="Visit",lstrBenefits_FixedIndemnityPlan_Point5TextPart2="or call",lstrBenefits_FixedIndemnityPlan_Point5TextPart3="(TTY: 1-855-889-4325) to find health coverage options",lstrBenefits_FixedIndemnityPlan_Point6Text="To find out if you can get health insurance through your job, or a family member's job, contact the employer",lstrBenefits_FixedIndemnityPlan_Point7TextPart1="For questions or complaints about this policy, contact your State Department of Insurance. Find their number on the National Association of Insurance Commissioners' website",lstrBenefits_FixedIndemnityPlan_Point7TextPart2='under "Insurance Departments."',lstrBenefits_Sentence_Adjusted_benefit_amount_until_EOI="Adjusted benefit amount until EOI is approved",lstrBenefits_Sentence_Annual_contribution="Annual contribution",lstrBenefits_Sentence_ApprovalsNotRequiredWhenEmpsAddB="Approvals are not required when employees add Beneficiaries and Dependents within the session.",lstrBenefits_Sentence_BenefitOptionsDisplayOrderBy="Benefit options display order by",lstrBenefits_Sentence_ChangedCurrDedGroupNotification="You have changed the current deduction group. This will cause all deductions that are not part of the new group to be automatically terminated.",lstrBenefits_Sentence_ChangingTheTypeOfThePlan="Changing the type of the plan could negatively impact your employees' ability to complete Open Enrollment or Life Events sessions if elections have been made for the selected plan.",lstrBenefits_Sentence_Confirm_Your_Elections_Or_Changes="Confirm your elections or changes",lstrBenefits_Sentence_Contribution_per_pay_check="Contribution per pay check",lstrBenefits_Sentence_DateSentRequired="Date sent From and To are required in order to view the report output. Please provide values for Date sent.",lstrBenefits_Sentence_Ded_Group_Assignment_Date="The 1095-C Deduction Group Assignment Date cannot be after t