ours cannot exceed the Less Than Work Hours.",lstrWFDBadConnectionIntro="The following fields are unavailable. The employee will be added to Pro Workforce Management. You can edit these values later by accessing the employee profile on the Pro Workforce Management page in UKG Pro.",lstrWFDValidation_EEJobChg_JobGroup_MaxWarning="UKG Dimensions: Please be advised that the assigned job group has 20+ secondary jobs flagged to auto add. If you utilize the 'secondary job to assignment' integration, the maximum jobs allowed per employee is 20. If your employee has more than 20 jobs, all existing job assignments may be inactivated and no further employee information will be synced. After assigning the employee to this job group, please inactivate any unnecessary jobs to prevent the employee from exceeding the max allowed amount.",lstrWFDValidation_NewHire_JobGroup_MaxWarning="UKG Dimensions: Please be advised that you are hiring this employee into a job group that has 20+ secondary jobs flagged to auto add. If you utilize the 'secondary job to assignment' integration, the maximum jobs allowed per employee is 20. If your employee has more than 20 jobs, all existing job assignments may be inactivated and no further employee information will be synced. After hiring this employee, please inactivate any unnecessary jobs to prevent the employee from exceeding the max allowed amount.",lstrWFMAcaPayTypeInfo="<li>ACA Pay Type - To make this available, please go to the UKG Pro Workforce Management Classic module in UKG Pro.",lstrwfmaddNewRecord="Add new record",lstrWFMAdminTeamInfo="<li>Admin Team - To make this available, please go to the UKG Pro Workforce Management Classic module in UKG Pro.",lstrWfmBadgeIdPopover="Badge ID only needs to be populated if you are using Pro Workforce Management with TeleStaff",lstrwfmbtnOk="Ok",lstrWfmCannotBeBlank="Cannot be blank",lstrWfmCannotBeDeletedBeforeJobStart="This record cannot be deleted because the previous record's effective date is be